# Cases and anything collected from a machine: never publish
output/*
!output/README.txt
dist/

# Third-party programs are fetched by scripts/Get-Tools.ps1 or added by hand; only the folder notes are tracked
tools/*
!tools/README.md

# Large or mixed-licence rule sets and third-party documents
config/rules/yara/community/

# Built files (attach them to a GitHub release instead)
*.exe
*.zip
*.sha256
*.log
*.tmp

# Editors and OS
.vs/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
